{"abstract":"This article presents the X-RAI (an acronym for transparent (X-RAY), Explainable (X), Responsible (R), and Accurate (A) Artificial Intelligence (AI)) Framework. The purpose is to provide a framework enabling responsible management and documentation of AI systems throughout their entire lifecycle. The intended audience is professionals working with AI in an organizational context. The X-RAI Framework was designed, developed, used, and evaluated during a six-year-long collaboration between the Danish Business Authority and the IT University of Copenhagen.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Nagbøl, Per Rådberg","Krancher, Oliver","Müller, Oliver"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-759407"],"filters":{"added":"2024-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, EU","OECD"],"country":["Germany"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Paderborn University"],"keyword":["AI governance","Explainable AI","Responsible AI"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"x rai a framework for a transparent explainable responsible and accurate use of artificial intelligence","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"doi","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/106272075/X-RAI-_A_Framework_for_a_Transparent_Explainable_Responsible_and_Accurate_Use_of_Artificial_Intelligence.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-759407","ids":["itu-6e21f067-f015-40d2-a6d4-8147b7e1ac1d"],"keyword":["AI documentation","AI governance","AI lifecycle management","Explainable AI","Responsible AI"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-A848054387EB1FB79691CF77F2A2C88E"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/106272075/X-RAI-_A_Framework_for_a_Transparent_Explainable_Responsible_and_Accurate_Use_of_Artificial_Intelligence.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT","IT University of Copenhagen, Digital Business Innovation, Information Systems and Digital Innovation"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"de","key":"paderborn university","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Paderborn University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Per Rådberg","key":"nagbølpau","last":"Nagbøl","name":"Nagbøl, Per Rådberg","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Oliver","key":"krancherpau","last":"Krancher","locid":"f14f4742-c9d8-4a34-b8e2-d713c3a1f437","name":"Krancher, Oliver","orcid":"0000-0003-3876-3604","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Oliver","key":"müllerpau","last":"Müller","name":"Müller, Oliver","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"status":"p"},"review":"Undetermined","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-6e21f067-f015-40d2-a6d4-8147b7e1ac1d"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"X-RAI: A Framework for a Transparent, Explainable, Responsible, and Accurate Use of Artificial Intelligence","type":"Other-Internet Publication","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-759407","year":"2024","yearsub":"2024"}
